  (text "Probe drive (GPIO4 PWM ~1 MHz) and peak detector" (at 134.62 190.5 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54) (thickness 0.508) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1879e77c-255d-513d-92bb-93b40d5e2ee8))
  (text "VBAT feeds the SuperMini 3V3 pin directly. Remove the SuperMini power LED and its 3.3 V regulator (5-pin chip next to USB-C)." (at 15.24 274.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2f4b467d-d945-5f2f-9d21-e6ee50e03566))
  (text "Never fit a Li-ion 14500 (4.2 V). USB-C on the SuperMini flashes the firmware and charges the battery through U1 (5V pin)." (at 15.24 279.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid fcfedd6f-e74d-5bd6-a119-94b2beb3c4ba))
  (text "RST button on the SuperMini = WAKE (measure now, blink code on its blue LED GPIO8). Timer wake every 6 h. Sensors: GPIO3 low = power on, I2C SDA GPIO7 / SCL GPIO10." (at 15.24 284.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d0ec40f9-b6c8-5ca6-b049-857c7673102a))
